#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:157
#: 39fbb3c3134f43dfa06a271cb90e0b8c
msgid "UART5 TX is located in the Video Output connector to provide IRC Tramp or Smart Audio control of video transmitters. See :ref:`common-vtx` for more information."
