msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-speedybeef405wing.rst:162
#: 82b0ff5ec79e40febbfe60e059623d69
msgid "GPIO 81 controls the VTX BEC output to pins marked \"9V\". Setting this GPIO high removes voltage supply to pins."
